WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Review the agency dashboard and application pipeline.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Start an application on a traveller’s behalf.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Prioritise orders, status and work needing attention.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
See which processing suppliers are connected.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Explore the supplier directory.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Configure a supplier connection request.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Open visa configuration.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Import a configured visa product from the catalogue.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Choose the storefront that will offer the product.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Manage the agency’s storefronts.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Create a storefront using a blank or existing setup.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Review storefront setup and outstanding configuration.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Manage email notification templates. Other channels shown may be planned.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Edit an email template and preview its content.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Review promotions and incentives.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Configure a campaign and its rules.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Review the recorded billing overview. Values are not a current offer.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Inspect usage and per-visa billing.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Review the configured settlement model and plan.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Check billing cycles and statements.
